<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include(`${partials}/head`, {noGlobalScripts: true}); -%>

<body>
<%- include(`${partials}/header_main`); -%>
<main class="ripe-farms-page">
<nav class="ripe-mobile-nav" aria-label="Ripe page navigation">
  <a href="../">[ Robinhood farms ]</a> <a href="/">[ vfat.tools ]</a>
</nav>
<pre class="ripe-banner">
************ UNOFFICIAL RIPE PROTOCOL + COMMUNITY ASSETS ************
INFO  : <a href="https://app.ripe.finance/robinhood/earn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://app.ripe.finance/robinhood/earn</a>
CHAIN : Robinhood Chain (4663)
NOTE  : Protocol vaults and community farms are shown separately. Rewards are
        only shown where Ripe's onchain configuration allocates RIPE emissions.
***********************************************************

WALLET: <span id="ripe-wallet-status">Wallet not connected</span> <button id="ripe-connect" class="ripe-link-button" type="button">[ Connect wallet ]</button>
</pre>

<p id="ripe-refresh-status" class="ripe-status" role="status" hidden></p>

<pre id="ripe-overview" class="ripe-summary" aria-live="polite" hidden></pre>

<p class="ripe-filter">DISPLAY : Yield-bearing assets only <button id="ripe-zero-apr-toggle" class="ripe-link-button" type="button">[ show 0 APR assets ]</button></p>

<div id="ripe-loading" class="ripe-loading" role="status" aria-live="polite">
  <span class="loader--1" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span id="ripe-loading-text">Reading Ripe’s onchain asset configuration…</span>
</div>

<section class="ripe-farms-section" aria-labelledby="ripe-protocol-assets-title">
  <h1 id="ripe-protocol-assets-title">========== RIPE PROTOCOL ASSETS ==========</h1>
  <p class="ripe-note">Ripe’s live protocol vault registry: WETH, RIPE, stability/governance assets, and tokenized stocks. Deposit and withdrawal actions go straight to the Ripe Teller. Deposit-closed legacy rows remain visible so existing positions can be withdrawn.</p>
  <div class="ripe-table-scroll">
    <div id="ripe-protocol-assets" aria-live="polite"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ripe-farms-section" aria-labelledby="ripe-farms-title">
  <h1 id="ripe-farms-title">========== COMMUNITY FARMS ==========</h1>
  <p class="ripe-note">Farm configuration, balances, and emissions come from Ripe contracts. USD values use live UP33 DEX pool state on Robinhood Chain—no price API. A farm without a liquid onchain USDG route remains unpriced instead of being guessed.</p>
  <div class="ripe-table-scroll">
    <div id="ripe-farms" aria-live="polite"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<pre class="ripe-footer-note">
HOW TO FARM: connect a wallet → choose a farm → approve the exact amount → deposit.
Withdrawals return the selected token directly to the connected wallet.
</pre>
</main>

<dialog id="ripe-action-dialog" class="ripe-action-dialog" aria-labelledby="ripe-action-title">
  <form method="dialog" class="ripe-dialog-close-row"><button type="submit">[ close ]</button></form>
  <div id="ripe-action-content"></div>
</dialog>
<style>
  .ripe-farms-page {
    margin: 20px 10px 50px;
    max-width: 1360px;
  }

  .ripe-farms-page, .ripe-farms-page * {
    font-family: monospace;
  }

  .ripe-mobile-nav { display: none; }

  .ripe-banner, .ripe-summary, .ripe-footer-note {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  .ripe-status { margin: -10px 0 18px; color: #d95757; font: 14px/1.4 monospace; }
  .ripe-filter { margin: -10px 0 18px; font: 14px/1.4 monospace; }
  .ripe-footer-note { margin-top: 24px; }
  .ripe-farms-section h1 {
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: normal;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ripe-note {
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ripe-link-button, .ripe-action-button, .ripe-action-dialog button {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    font: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .ripe-link-button:hover, .ripe-action-button:hover, .ripe-action-dialog button:hover {
    color: var(--highlight-color);
  }

  .ripe-action-button:disabled, .ripe-action-dialog button:disabled {
    cursor: not-allowed;
    opacity: .45;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ripe-table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ripe-farm-table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 1060px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .ripe-farm-table th, .ripe-farm-table td {
    padding: 7px 9px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    vertical-align: top;
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ripe-farm-table th:first-child, .ripe-farm-table td:first-child,
  .ripe-farm-table th:last-child, .ripe-farm-table td:last-child { text-align: left; }
  .ripe-farm-table th { font-weight: bold; }
  .ripe-farm-table .ripe-farm-name, .ripe-farm-table .ripe-farm-symbol {
    display: block;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    white-space: normal;
  }

  .ripe-farm-table .ripe-farm-symbol { margin-top: 3px; color: var(--highlight-color); }
  .ripe-farm-table .ripe-price-tvl span { display: block; }
  .ripe-farm-table .ripe-price-tvl span + span { margin-top: 3px; }
  .ripe-farm-table .ripe-total-staked span { display: block; }
  .ripe-farm-table .ripe-total-staked span + span { margin-top: 3px; }
  .ripe-farm-table .ripe-actions { min-width: 112px; white-space: normal; }
  .ripe-farm-table .ripe-actions > * { display: block; }
  .ripe-farm-table .ripe-actions > * + * { margin-top: 4px; }
  .ripe-loading { padding: 10px 0; }
  .ripe-loading[hidden] { display: none; }

  .ripe-action-dialog {
    width: min(570px, calc(100vw - 32px));
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    background: var(--main-background-color);
    color: var(--main-text-color);
  }

  .ripe-action-dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .55); }
  .ripe-dialog-close-row { margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: right; }
  .ripe-action-dialog h2 {
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    color: inherit;
    font: bold 16px/1.4 monospace;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ripe-action-dialog p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: inherit; font: 14px/1.5 monospace; text-align: left; }
  .ripe-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--highlight-color); font: 14px/1.4 monospace; }
  .ripe-action-balance { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin: 12px 0 6px; font: 14px/1.4 monospace; }
  .ripe-input-row { display: flex; }
  .ripe-input-row input {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 5px 7px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    font: 16px/1.4 monospace;
  }

  .ripe-input-row button { margin-left: 10px; }
  .ripe-action-note { min-height: 40px; margin: 10px 0; font: 13px/1.45 monospace; }
  .ripe-dialog-actions { display: flex; gap: 16px; }
  .ripe-action-tx { display: inline-block; margin-top: 14px; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    body > div:not(.modal) { display: none; }
    .ripe-farms-page { margin: 14px 8px 40px; }
    .ripe-mobile-nav { display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .ripe-banner, .ripe-summary, .ripe-footer-note { font-size: 12px; }
    .ripe-table-scroll { overflow: visible; }
    .ripe-farm-table { min-width: 0; font-size: 13px; table-layout: fixed; }
    .ripe-farm-table th, .ripe-farm-table td { padding: 7px; }
    .ripe-farm-table th { white-space: normal; }
    .ripe-farm-table th:nth-child(4), .ripe-farm-table td:nth-child(4),
    .ripe-farm-table th:nth-child(5), .ripe-farm-table td:nth-child(5),
    .ripe-farm-table th:nth-child(6), .ripe-farm-table td:nth-child(6),
    .ripe-farm-table th:nth-child(7), .ripe-farm-table td:nth-child(7) { display: none; }
    .ripe-farm-table th:nth-child(1) { width: 35%; }
    .ripe-farm-table th:nth-child(2) { width: 29%; }
    .ripe-farm-table th:nth-child(3) { width: 18%; }
    .ripe-farm-table th:nth-child(8) { width: 18%; }
    .ripe-farm-table td:first-child { white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .ripe-farm-table .ripe-actions { min-width: 0; }
    .ripe-farm-table .ripe-actions a { display: none; }
  }
</style>
<% if (filenameMap) { %>
<script src="<%= PP %>/js/<%= filenameMap['robinhood_ripe.js'] %>"></script>
<% } else { %>
<script src="<%= PP %>/js/robinhood_ripe.js"></script>
<% } %>
</body>
</html>
